      "prompt": "Use case: stylized-concept. Art-direction matched landscape asset sheet for the Mira learning arcade. A perfectly regular 2x2 grid of four full-bleed wide rectangular illustrations with narrow straight warm-white cross gutter exactly at the midpoint; each will be cropped into a game asset. Top left: little midnight garden theater with dark spruce draped curtains and gold paper lanterns far to the edges, quiet flat pale warm parchment screen in the center, empty stage, no cast shadow or actors. Top right: top-down river irrigation garden with soft moss and turquoise at the edges, little canal stones and wetland flowers only at the margin, quiet teal open water in center, no characters or internal paths. Bottom left: an apricot sky and snowy blue-teal distant mountains, high alpine meadow and wispy clouds, empty central sky, no planes or landing pads. Bottom right: large single warm cream origami paper glider tilted pointing to the right, spruce green paper seam and persimmon accent, centered on a plain evenly flat contrasting warm plum ground, generous room around its entire silhouette. Matte gouache, fine dry paper grain, crisp cut-paper shapes, calm deep spruce shadows, warm cream, restrained apricot highlights, crafted storybook arcade art. No lettering, numbers, graphics, logo or watermark in any panel.",
